tart":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"corepkgs is a base layer, not a general package set. Its scope is narrower than\nnixpkgs by design, so that updates land more often and less has to be rebuilt when\nthey do.","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}}}]},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Four kinds of thing belong.","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}}}]},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The build environment itself.","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}}}]},{"type":"text","value":" The stdenv, and the compilers, interpreters and\ntoolchains it needs to work.","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}}}]},{"type":"code","lang":"text","filename":"build environment","value":"  pkgs/gcc/                          the default compiler\n  pkgs-many/llvm/                    LLVM, several versions\n  pkgs-many/gcc-releases/            GCC, several releases\n  pkgs-many/binutils/                the linker and binutils\n  pkgs-many/autoconf/  automake/     the autotools\n  pkgs-many/cmake/  meson/  ninja/   the build systems","class":"excerpt"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Language ecosystems, and the tools around them.","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}}}]},{"type":"text","value":" An interpreter or compiler,\nplus the ecosystem tooling a project of that language expects — package managers,\nlinters, test runners.","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}}}]},{"type":"code","lang":"text","filename":"language ecosystems","value":"  python/cpython/      python/pkgs/   the interpreter and 178 packages\n  pkgs-many/perl/      perl/pkgs/     the interpreter and 172 packages\n  pkgs-many/rust/      pkgs-many/go/  the toolchains\n  python/pkgs/pip/     python/pkgs/virtualenv/\n  python/pkgs/mypy/    python/pkgs/black/   a type checker and a formatter\n  pkgs-many/nodejs/    pkgs-many/pnpm/      a runtime and its package manager","class":"excerpt"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1},"end":{"line":50,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1},"end":{"line":48,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The logic that assembles a package set.","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1},"end":{"line":48,"column":1}}}]},{"type":"text","value":" Overlays, package scopes, and the\nmachinery that turns directories into attributes is part of the product, not an\nimplementation detail.","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1},"end":{"line":48,"column":1}}}]},{"type":"code","lang":"text","filename":"package-set logic","value":"  stdenv/stage.nix                   layers the package set from overlays\n  top-level.nix                      the top-level overlay\n  stdenv/splice.nix                  keeps build and host inputs apart\n  python/passthrufun.nix             the Python package set's scope\n  haskell/make-package-set.nix       the Haskell package set's scope","class":"excerpt"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":64,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"What a running system needs.","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}}}]},{"type":"text","valu